    "figure": "basics-packaging-diagram-package-section",
    "after": "basics-packaging-p0",
    "paragraphExcerpt": "一颗 GPU 怎么与周围的 HBM 高速连接？如果一颗芯片太大、造不出来，能否拆成几块再组装？",
    "src": "/handbook/diagrams/893940b374d6254c4527.svg"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "basics-packaging",
    "kind": "curated-diagram",
    "key": "packaging-types",
    "figure": "basics-packaging-diagram-packaging-types",
    "after": "basics-packaging-p71",
    "paragraphExcerpt": "以部分 2.5D 方案为例，计算裸片与 HBM 放在硅中介层等结构上，由精细线路连接。中介层不是 GPU 晶圆本身，封装方式也不只有一种。",
    "src": "/handbook/diagrams/c3fe9e2ba72557232563.svg"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "basics-memory",
    "kind": "curated-diagram",
    "key": "memory-map",
    "figure": "basics-memory-diagram-memory-map",
    "after": "basics-memory-p160",
    "paragraphExcerpt": "DRAM 用电容及晶体管保存状态，断电丢失且需要刷新；NAND 用存储单元保存电荷，断电后仍可保留数据。服务器 DRAM、HBM 和 SSD 都离不开存储芯片，但它们不是同一种产品。",
    "src": "/handbook/diagrams/eb57cc76abeaf10bccbc.svg"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "basics-optics",
    "kind": "curated-diagram",
    "key": "optical-path",
    "figure": "basics-optics-diagram-optical-path",
    "after": "basics-optics-p1",
    "paragraphExcerpt": "光通信由器件、模块、交换系统和连接组成，客户架构、端口数、速率升级与传输距离决定需求。",
    "src": "/handbook/diagrams/cb8be50c8078fced79d4.svg"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "basics-pcb",
    "kind": "curated-diagram",
    "key": "pcb-stack",
    "figure": "basics-pcb-diagram-pcb-stack",
    "after": "basics-pcb-p1",
    "paragraphExcerpt": "覆铜板是 PCB 的核心材料之一。高频高速和高层数会增加材料、加工、测试与良率要求。",
    "src": "/handbook/diagrams/787a939759a2b386ca29.svg"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "basics-pcb",
    "kind": "curated-diagram",
    "key": "pcb-process",
    "figure": "basics-pcb-diagram-pcb-process",
    "after": "basics-pcb-p233",
    "paragraphExcerpt": "制造一般涉及线路图形、蚀刻、层压、钻孔、孔金属化、表面处理与测试等。高层数和高速高频应用往往提高设计及制造难度，但层数不是唯一判断标准：良率、交期、可靠性和客户认证也很重要。",
    "src": "/handbook/diagrams/3d568ff2afd7c85f5d70.svg"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "basics-equipment",
    "kind": "curated-diagram",
    "key": "fab-process",
    "figure": "basics-equipment-diagram-fab-process",
    "after": "basics-equipment-p1",
    "paragraphExcerpt": "设备是晶圆厂的生产工具，不同工序之间相互依赖。新厂扩产、技术升级、备件和维护都会产生需求。",
    "src": "/handbook/diagrams/063d53f81bdc6991eedc.svg"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "basics-equipment",
    "kind": "curated-diagram",
    "key": "proof-ladder",
    "figure": "basics-equipment-diagram-proof-ladder",
    "after": "basics-equipment-p107",
    "paragraphExcerpt": "样机进入客户产线 → 对指定工序测试 → 稳定性与良率验证 → 客户复购和扩展工序。某公司在某一工序突破，并不意味着已覆盖所有先进节点或所有刻蚀类型。设备的长期服务、零部件及工艺协同也影响竞争力。",
    "src": "/handbook/diagrams/d73b5475dac616c7f52b.svg"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "basics-materials",
    "kind": "curated-diagram",
    "key": "materials-use",
    "figure": "basics-materials-diagram-materials-use",
    "after": "basics-materials-p65",
    "paragraphExcerpt": "高纯硅制成单晶硅棒，切片、研磨和抛光形成硅片。不同尺寸、缺陷水平与先进工艺要求对应不同产品。",
    "src": "/handbook/diagrams/3a0c6d55c51e8985d767.svg"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "basics-server",
    "kind": "curated-diagram",
    "key": "power-path",
    "figure": "basics-server-diagram-power-path",
    "after": "basics-server-p207",
    "paragraphExcerpt": "一家云厂商准备部署一万张加速卡。芯片运抵机房以后，还要解决电网接入、供配电、服务器供电、散热和网络连接。任何一环延误，都可能让设备无法按计划投入使用。",
    "src": "/handbook/diagrams/1162444d9915bd829802.svg"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "basics-server",
    "kind": "curated-diagram",
    "key": "cooling-loops",
    "figure": "basics-server-diagram-cooling-loops",
    "after": "basics-server-p215",
    "paragraphExcerpt": "冷板式液冷通过冷板带走芯片热量，再经管路和热交换系统传递到外部冷源；浸没式则采用不同结构。比较时要看功率密度、系统效率、维护、改造成本与可靠性。机柜液冷零件、分配单元和机房冷源是不同市场。",
    "src": "/handbook/diagrams/701aaf6f567fbd8dc42d.svg"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "basics-robot",
    "kind": "curated-diagram",
    "key": "robot-loop",
    "figure": "basics-robot-diagram-robot-loop",
    "after": "basics-robot-p1",
    "paragraphExcerpt": "机器人链条广，但展示视频、样机和稳定量产是不同阶段。真正的市场取决于可靠性、成本和场景价值。",
    "src": "/handbook/diagrams/3dd686390875a1b3bce9.svg"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "basics-robot",
    "kind": "curated-diagram",
    "key": "proof-ladder",
    "figure": "basics-robot-diagram-proof-ladder",
    "after": "basics-robot-p116",
    "paragraphExcerpt": "一次抓取成功可以证明特定环境下的技术可行性；客户批量采购还要看能否连续稳定运行、安全维护、成本、任务节拍和售后。把进度拆成：实验室演示 → 真实场景测试 → 付费试点 → 批量交付 → 稳定复购。",
    "src": "/handbook/diagrams/d73b5475dac616c7f52b.svg"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "basics-mlcc",
    "kind": "curated-diagram",
    "key": "mlcc-section",
    "figure": "basics-mlcc-diagram-mlcc-section",
    "after": "basics-mlcc-p0",
    "paragraphExcerpt": "一台 AI 服务器有许多看不见的小元件：芯片高速工作时，供电为什么还需要大量电容？",
    "src": "/handbook/diagrams/57fac8a8f798e3a5bd43.svg"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "basics-mcu",
    "kind": "curated-diagram",
    "key": "mcu-block",
    "figure": "basics-mcu-diagram-mcu-block",
    "after": "basics-mcu-p1",
    "paragraphExcerpt": "MCU 是把处理器、内存和外设接口等整合在一颗芯片上的控制器；NOR Flash 是非易失性存储器，两者功能不同。",
    "src": "/handbook/diagrams/42228a7575ca577e2d2b.svg"
  }
]